    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41664" root="وجب" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوَجِّبٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>whose biestings coagulate in her udder.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِجَابٌ</span>
<i>Places in which water stagnates:</i> (K:) pl. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span> <i>A large skin of the kind
called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِقَاءٌ</span>, <i>made of the</i> (<i>complete,</i> TA,) <i>hide of
a he-goat:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وِجَابٌ</span>. (AHn, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span>
<i>Stupid; foolish; of little sense.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span>
(S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَّابٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَّابَةٌ</span></b>  (IAar, K)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوَجِّبٌ</span></b>  (IAar) <i>A coward; cowardly;
pusillanimous.</i> (S, K, &amp;c.) [The second and
third, and more especially the latter, are probably

intensive epithets.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْبٌ</span> <i>A bet, wager,</i> or
<i>stake, at a shooting-match</i> (Lh, K) or <i>a race.</i>
(IAar; and L in TA, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَدَبٌ</span>.)

